    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82008" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιπταίω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stumble upon</i>, c. dat., <i><span class="en">
